{"created": "2024-03-18T13:25:20.800508+00:00", "modified": "2024-03-18T13:25:21.228775+00:00", "id": 10829958, "conceptrecid": "10829957", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10829958", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.10829957", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10829958", "metadata": {"title": "Experimental load-displacement response of a stainless steel specimen under cyclic loading", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10829958", "publication_date": "2024-03-18", "description": "<p>Experimental load-displacement data was obtained by testing a autenitic stainless steel RHS member under cyclic bending around its major axis following a cantilever loading scheme. The database is comprised of the horizontal displacement measured by a string potentiometer attached at the free end of the specimen and the horizontal force introduced by the actuator.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The data corresponds to the specimen named S1-L1, which was an austenitic stainless steel RHS specimen, with a cross-section S1 (120 &times; 80 &times; 6 mm) and an effective length of L1 = 1650 mm.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The full details of the experimental test can be found in: Gonz&aacute;lez-de-Le&oacute;n I., Nastri E., Arrayago I., Montuori R., Piluso V., Real E. Experimental study on stainless steel tubular members under cyclic loading. Thin-Walled Structures 181, 109969, 2022. DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tws.2022.109969.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Gonz\u00e1lez-de-Le\u00f3n, Isabel", "affiliation": "Universitat Polit\u00e8cnica de Catalunya", "orcid": "0000-0003-2667-9931"}, {"name": "Nastri, Elide", "affiliation": "University of Salerno", "orcid": "0000-0002-4880-9672"}, {"name": "Arrayago, Itsaso", "affiliation": "Universitat Polit\u00e8cnica de Catalunya", "orcid": "0000-0002-0054-9322"}, {"name": "Montuori, Rosario", "affiliation": "University of Salerno"}, {"name": "Piluso, Vincenzo", "affiliation": "University of Salerno", "orcid": "0000-0002-4630-5614"}, {"name": "Real, Esther", "affiliation": "Universitat Polit\u00e8cnica de Catalunya", "orcid": "0000-0003-1723-3380"}], "keywords": ["Stainless steel specimen", "Cyclic behaviour", "Tests results", "Experimental hysteretic loops"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1016/j.tws.2022.109969", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "references": ["Gonz\u00e1lez-de-Le\u00f3n I., Nastri E., Arrayago I., Montuori R., Piluso V., Real E. Experimental study on stainless steel tubular members under cyclic loading. Thin-Walled Structures 181, 109969, 2022. DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tws.2022.109969"], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "journal": {"issue": "109969", "title": "Thin-Walled Structures", "volume": "181"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "BIA2016-75678-R, AEI/FEDER", "internal_id": "034900433::BIA2016-75678-R, AEI/FEDER", "funder": {"name": "Ministry of Economy, Industry and Competitiveness"}, "title": "Comportamiento estructural de p\u00f3rticos de acero inoxidable. Seguridad frente a acciones accidentales de sismo y fuego"}, {"code": "BES-2017-082958", "internal_id": "05r0vyz12::BES-2017-082958", "funder": {"name": "Ministerio de Ciencia, Innovaci\u00f3n y Universidades"}, "title": "Predoctoral grant"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "10829957"}}]}}, "title": "Experimental load-displacement response of a stainless steel specimen under cyclic loading", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10829958", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10829958", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/10829958?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10829958", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10829958", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.10829958", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/10829958/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/108299